From 74461c42c6ff7e3410ca7085882e75a9391ae95d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bjgo78 <bjgo78@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:17:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Euicc: Do not build XiaomiEuicc

XiaomiEuicc requires EuiccPolicy, which Clover does not have, so the
Make module check fails:

  TARGET module XiaomiEuicc requires non-existent TARGET module:
  EuiccPolicy

camellia does not ship this package, so drop its build file.
---
 packages/Euicc/Android.bp | 18 ------------------
 1 file changed, 18 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 packages/Euicc/Android.bp

diff --git a/packages/Euicc/Android.bp b/packages/Euicc/Android.bp
deleted file mode 100644
index 680cb93..0000000
--- a/packages/Euicc/Android.bp
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,18 +0,0 @@
-
-//
-// SPDX-FileCopyrightText: The LineageOS Project
-// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
-//
-
-phony {
-    name: "XiaomiEuicc",
-    required: [
-        "EuiccPolicy",
-        "EuiccPolicyXiaomi",
-    ],
-}
-
-runtime_resource_overlay {
-    name: "EuiccPolicyXiaomi",
-    product_specific: true,
-}
-- 
2.43.0

